ng angry asking them what in  the world are they doing  you gotta respect them although it is  stupid that they are messing around  in the face of two yonko clearly none of  them are that intimidated  if they have the time to mess around  like that kaido tells big mom to stand  back  and she comments that he's playing with  his food again i think in kaido's mind  he is more sure of himself taking on big  mom  than he is taking on those five  characters he thought of when he looked  at luffy that's why big mom wasn't one  of them  and probably why he feels comfortable  teaming up with her since he thinks  he can take care of her later here he's  clearly okay with giving orders to big  mom  and big mom actually goes with it for a  while keep in mind she said luffy was  hers before  but clearly kaido's been getting more  chances to fight with him here  zoro recognized killer as the man slayer  and of course zoro beat him in the past  zorro puts his bandana on so you know  things are getting serious  it's funny here because these two have a  similar rivalry as kit and luffy and  killer says that he would have beaten  zorro  if he had his punishers back then  meaning his weapons of choice  zoro retorts it would have ended the  same regardless and i for one  obviously think killer isn't on zorro's  level but i  like that at least killer acts  competitive i'm enjoying the rivalries  even as they fight on the same side  both these supernova take shots at kaido  and i've been saying that i think zoro  is gonna cut  kaido but this is not that moment there  are pressure marks left on kaido's neck  but it didn't break the skin  and kaido isn't surprised he expected as  much from these two  these are definitely not odin cuts yet  nevertheless the odin comparison is very  significant here  zoro says to himself that he needs to  release more of enma's power  and enema was wielded by none other than  odin and was one of the weapons he used  to injure kaido  this blade will no doubt play a part in  his eventual defeat enma is a reference  to a god who presides over hell  this god is the personification of death  like the shinigami  we know how big mythology is for oda who  used mythology as the inspiration for  kaido's gyarados devil fruit  is it not fitting then for odin's blade  and a blade that mythologically  represents  death to play a role in beating or maybe  killing a seemingly invincible mythical  creature the symbolism is too heavy to  pass up in my opinion and zorro is  clearly not shaken here and he will as  he says release more of enemas power  that is inevitable however for now we  jump back to the supernova captains and  luffy is overconfident as usual here  saying he'll settle this fight in an  instant we get a great moment where all  three supernova captains prepare to  attack kaido  together in a combo chain kaido smiles  and welcomes them to bring it on  he calls the brats little monsters which  is a sign of respect but  patronizing at the same time as if they  can't compete with the big or real  monsters like kaido  they all take different approaches luffy  his straightforward one that already  hurt kaido  kid will try crushing him with that  makeshift mecha of his and law says  he'll take him apart from within  probably the most interesting strategy  kaido then gets hit by luffy with a kong  gun an attack that could punch around  king kong himself  kid then uses punk vice to seemingly  crush the yonko  and law uses tac to drop large boulders  on him this epic combo from out of our  fanboy dreams  does not do much though big mom laughs  and then kaido laughs and comes out in  his dragon form i'm not sure why he'd  switch to this form and we'll see how he  plans to fight with it next chapter but  not gonna lie i kind of wanted him to  stay in his humanoid form  what the transformation is good for  though is creating an  epic panel where our guys on the bottom  of the panel are completely overwhelmed  visually  by kaido and big mom towering over them  and taking a large portion  of the upper half of the panel the panel  shows us what our supernova  are seeing from their perspectives and  symbolically shows how difficult the  task they are attempting to undertake  will be  this literally looks like humans  associated with earth attempting to  challenge  the gods associated with the skies or  heavens kaido then says it's a shame he  has to kill them but it can't be helped  he's no longer trying to make them his  subordinates he now 100  plans to kill them and what's more to  take everything they have  including their friends treasure  poneglyphs and so on as  kaido says the victor of this battle  will take a massive step towards  becoming the pirate king  and we're told this is an inevitable  clash as we  see a close-up of kaido and then luffy  clearly they are the centerpieces of  this  intense battle i don't have to tell you  how crazy or hyped this  is it's so awesome to see kaido finally  taking them seriously  even saying the victor of this battle  rather than saying i'll take a massive  step to become the pirate king and we  know that luffy beating a yonko  will be an insanely massive leap towards  becoming pirate king but the fact that  even a yonko feels that beating him will  get the yonko  massively closer shows how much respect  luffy has earned  and how far he has come the inevitable  clash comment  is a nice addition too because not  everyone can be the pirate king and  since everyone wants it eventually you  have to clash with others who also want  it until one remains  they are all trying to turn their dream  into a reality the only question is who  will manifest their will into the world  who has the most powerful will the most  unwavering commitment  although you could argue that will can't  overcome the gap in natural talent and  strength one piece has shown time and  time again  that those with the strongest will find  a way to make the impossible possible  as they go even if they don't know how  they'll get there  they trust in themselves that they'll  figure it out if they don't give up and  keep moving forward  luffy's story is beyond inspirational  and as i mentioned  even though these chapters are good in  and of themselves they are leading to  better and more intense ones as we move  forward which is a good thing because  now that kaido messed around with them a  bit we can expect to see  more serious fighting moving forward and  let's appreciate that this whole chapter  followed the insanely intense and epic  happenings  on the roof moving forward these guys  are probably going to be  sharing chapters with the non-main  battles taking place which is cool  they're all going to be interesting in  their own right i'm sure of that  but we all know this is the main event  we've been dying to see  but yeah i had more to say about this  chapter than i thought i would  so thank you to everyone who stay tuned  until the very end if you did enjoy and  want to keep the one piece reviews  coming the best thing you could do is  smash that like button like a true  pirate king if you haven't be sure to  join the nakama by subscribing and this  is crucial hit that notification bell or  else you will miss  future chapter reviews it appears there  will be a break next week but never fear  while you wait for the next intense  chapter to drop feel free to check out  my growing one piece playlist where i  got  videos about the yonko warlords  supernova  and other truly epic topics link to that  playlist is in the description  and i especially want to thank the  patron squad over on patreon  and here on youtube who helped make  videos like this one possible first  and foremost i want to thank the patron  of legend the one acknowledged by lord  tuigo himself  and the most donated champion of the  world alpha sigma and  are the one tier patrons the ones who  stand atop all clans ingrata the world  acquire respect but they have a  heparithian emperor otaku spidey life  tinel fake buddhist and tungsten tarkis  and our pro hero tier patrons the one  and only gilgamesh steelers angel crews  anatoly kazowski joel stanton very gucci  jessica kayla fond ruthu and aura alicia  actor  bonnie parks hinokami and water the  red-haired raven florian  joanne garcia jack watches anime fat boy  games deadly saint matthew cruz anthony  schreiber  hi jinx and mr waffles thank you all so  much  if you do enjoy our work you can support  more of it by going over to patreon.com  anime uproar and becoming a patron today  for as little as one dollar  if you do so you'll get your name  featured in future videos alongside  these amazing people right here and  you'll even get access to our private  patron only discord where we talk about  anime  life and of course thank memes so check  out patreon.com anime upload link in the  description if you're interested you can  also join the youtube channel by  clicking that blue join button next to  the subscribe button that you've  hopefully already destroyed  so yeah you can support more content  that way if you prefer whichever way you  choose to support us you can get the  same great benefits  thanks again and until next time see ya  space cowboys  [Music]  me
 

